<P STYLE="font: 8pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; text-align: left; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</P>
<P STYLE="font: 8pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; text-align: left; text-indent: 0in">* Monthly and annual returns
  for which some or all performance data reflects actual historical performance marked in blue</P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 6pt 0.3in; text-align: center; text-indent: -0.3in"><B><I>PAST PERFORMANCE
  IS NOT INDICATIVE OF FUTURE RESULTS</I></B></P>
