<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 12pt">To: [ipathredemptions@barclays.com]</P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 12pt">Subject: iPath<FONT STYLE="font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif"><SUP>&reg;</SUP></FONT> Notice of Redemption, CUSIP No.</P>
