<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 12pt; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: right"><B>ANNEX B</B></P>
<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 9pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0in">CONFIRMATION OF REDEMPTION<a name="COR"></a></P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 12pt">Dated:</P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0 0 12pt">Barclays Bank PLC</P>
